<title>JAPAN: Royal Hotel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Royal Hotel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.11		vs	   16.48</p>
<p> Operating	  246    million    vs	  380    million</p>
<p> Current	     55    million    vs	  105    million</p>
<p> Net		   43    million    vs	   58    million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.71 yen	  vs	    0.95 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     62 million	  vs	  62 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Royal Hotel Ltd is based in Osaka.</p>
</text>
